   * Collects [word, value] pairs under a node in code point order.
   * @param {Node} node Node to start from.
   * @param {string} prefixStr Word represented by that node.
   * @param {Array<[string, unknown]>} out Accumulator.
   * @param {number} limit Maximum number of entries to collect.
